Third-party code and data

original_2021/carcarcar.cpp is a 2021 scratch file. Alongside my own code it
contains a copy of the OpenCV groupRectangles implementation, pasted in at the
time while studying how OpenCV merges overlapping detections. That block is not
my code and remains under OpenCV's own license (BSD-3-Clause for OpenCV 4.4 and
earlier, Apache-2.0 from 4.5.0); the README marks it. Everything else in the
file, including the calibration numbers, is mine.

clips/robot_clip.mp4 is footage recorded by the HITCRT robotics team in 2021
and is included for evaluating the code in this repository.
